From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kernel-builder <kernel-builder@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: sun8iw15p1: enable BakaSU manual hook

The BakaSU setup script supplies the KernelSU sources and required
Kconfig/Makefile integration during CI. Select the manual hook for Linux 4.9.

---
 arch/arm/configs/sun8iw15p1smp_android_ntx_defconfig | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/sun8iw15p1smp_android_ntx_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/sun8iw15p1smp_android_ntx_defconfig
--- a/arch/arm/configs/sun8iw15p1smp_android_ntx_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/sun8iw15p1smp_android_ntx_defconfig
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
+# BakaSU
+CONFIG_KSU=y
+CONFIG_KSU_MANUAL_HOOK=y
 #
 # Automatically generated file; DO NOT EDIT.
 # Linux/arm 4.9.56 Kernel Configuration
